{"id":"603647","name":"西红柿鸡蛋烩饼","author":"优子家的味道","authorId":"9910251","desc":"","cover":"images/603647/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"饼子","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"适量适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱姜蒜。","img":"images/603647/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香肠切片。","img":"images/603647/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"青椒切丝。","img":"images/603647/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"西红柿切块。","img":"images/603647/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"香菜沫葱花。","img":"images/603647/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"饼子切块。","img":"images/603647/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"油热后下入菜码。","img":"images/603647/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒香后倒入香肠。","img":"images/603647/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"依次倒入料酒、酱油。","img":"images/603647/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒香后放入青椒。","img":"images/603647/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"青椒炒断生后放入西红柿。","img":"images/603647/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"依次放入盐、十三香。","img":"images/603647/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"生抽。","img":"images/603647/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"炒出汤汁以后打入鸡蛋。","img":"images/603647/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"鸡蛋成型后放入味精。","img":"images/603647/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"搅拌均匀放入饼子。","img":"images/603647/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"饼子裹满汤汁即可出锅。","img":"images/603647/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"装碗后放入香菜沫和葱花。","img":"images/603647/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"喜欢吃辣的可以配上油泼辣椒。","img":"images/603647/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"色香味俱全。","img":"images/603647/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"搅拌均匀即可食用。","img":"images/603647/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"青椒可以根据个人喜好，鸡蛋一定要炒出汤汁以后打进去，这样更入味。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}